{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch2SSpsksRMPvD8ihvvJQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've fixed the portrait-phone morning screen in `原型/v1.7/index.html`. On day 2, once the makeup box is packed, you can now see 阿檀 and the whole mirror, and the face in the mirror is clear. `check_engine` passes and `index.packed.html` has been rebuilt.\n\n**What was actually wrong** (some of the brief's guesses were off):\n- **Mirror:** in portrait the scene only shows about 2.3 m of table width. The mirror sits outside that on the right, and the makeup box sits outside it on the left.\n- **Squashed scene and empty gap above 出门:** the camera framed the scene on the centre of the whole screen, but the top bar takes ~280px and the subtitle and cards take the bottom. So the table was squeezed into the upper half, and empty tabletop filled the space above the subtitle.\n- **熄/痕 and 图鉴 in the middle of the scene:** the brief guessed a CSS `top: 158px` problem, but the code already positions that strip correctly on phones. The top bar was just too tall and pushed it down onto the scene.\n\n**What I changed** (phones held upright only):\n- **Top bar:** day, starter and 卖座 now sit on one line. The water board is a small tag next to 乐/规矩. The two intel lines fit on one row. At 390×844 the top area went from ~280px to ~150px. At 360px wide, the word 「起手」 is dropped and only the round badge stays.\n- **Camera:** in the morning on an upright phone, the camera moves right and back. 阿檀 is on the left and the mirror on the right, both fully in frame. The scene is now centred in the strip between the top bar and the subtitle, so nothing important is hidden behind the interface. It also re-frames when you rotate the phone.\n- **Day 3+ morning:** the spread of cards in the backstage shop no longer covers 熄/痕 and 图鉴.\n- **Desktop and phone landscape** look the same as before. Stage, door, evening, night, rules and water board were checked upright, with no new overlaps.\n\n**Still not solved:**\n- The physical makeup box on the left of the table is out of frame in the new upright morning shot. A narrow screen can't fit the box, 阿檀 and the mirror at a useful size, and the card row at the bottom already is the box.\n- On tall screens like 390×844, about 50px of tabletop is still left above the subtitle. At a WeChat-sized height (390×680) it's nearly gone.\n- On stage, upright, the 熄/痕 strip still sits on the top edge of the stage. It doesn't block the actor or the cards, so I left it.\n- Excluded by the brief, so not touched: the event card covering the morning cards, the landscape 「满堂红」 banner, the five new items still missing art (needs Codex), and the music.\n- I only tested in a browser simulator, not on a real phone or inside WeChat. It's worth one look on your phone after the next publish.\n\nScreenshots are in `設計/美術/feedback_v17/qa_mobile/`: before and after at 390, 375 and 360 wide, a WeChat-height 390×680, a mirror close-up, landscape, desktop, and the other times of day. Write-ups are in `設計/美術/V17_MOBILE_LAYOUT_RESULT.md` and `V17_MOBILE_LAYOUT_PROGRESS.md`.\n\nPer the brief, I didn't commit or push, even though `CLAUDE.md` normally says to push after changes. Say the word if you want it pushed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1526,"cache_read_input_tokens":158775,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1526},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"14631641-e1b7-4e19-b3b7-9c4cd1155a1e","uuid":"d14f24bc-2658-4a06-848e-63506fef6599","timestamp":"2026-11-14T07:38:50.966Z","request_id":"req_011Ch2SSpKWRgtkdfwfbbPHn"}
